<title>CHINA: C.Lyonnais sets warrants on conglomerates basket.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets warrants on conglomerates basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Thursday it launched 900 million American style call warrants on a basket of conglomerate stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p>China Merchants Holdings Co Int'l Co Ltd   0.06 shrs</p>
<p> China Everbright-IHD Pacific Ltd	    0.04 shrs</p>
<p> CITIC Pacific Ltd				 0.01 shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$2.2905	PREMIUM	  20.88 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.0786	GEARING	  3.24x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  22.MAY.98	LISTING DATE   13.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	PAYDATE	  11.AUG.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$2.545	 MIN EXER LOT   20,000</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT	  CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>			 DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
